    description: "WHAT\nTwo analyzers read a declaration's name from the wrong token. These are two independent fixes in two analyzers, grouped because the defect is the same (wrong name on an emitted or missing symbol) and both were found by the v19 locals sweep.\n1. Scala: a method with a symbolic name (`def &&(o: A)`, `def +(that: A)`) is not emitted under its name. The locals agent reported it emitted as method `A.o` (the parameter name). On the PR tip the drafting agent observed two other outcomes: with body `= this` each such def is emitted as a constructor `A.this`; with body `= true` / `= 1` no symbol is emitted. The fixture behind the agent's `A.o` observation is not on disk.\n2. Ruby: `class Foo :: Bar` (spaces around `::`) is emitted as class `Foo`. (`class Foo::Baz` is right: name `Foo::Baz`, node id name slot `Foo..Baz` by the id grammar's colon rule.)\n\nREPRO\n~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/residuals/probes/mixed/a.scala:\n  class A(val v: Int) { def &&(o: A): A = this ; def ||(other: A): A = this }\n  -> scala:a.scala:2-2:A.this:constructor and scala:a.scala:3-3:A.this:constructor\n~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/residuals/probes/mixed2/a.scala:\n  def &&(o: A): Boolean = true ; def +(that: A): Int = 1 ; def plus(that: A): Int = 1\n  -> only scala:a.scala:4-4:A.plus:method\n~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/residuals/probes/mixed/b.rb:\n  class Foo :: Bar ... end -> ruby:b.rb:1-3:Foo:class, name Foo, its method Foo#m (re-run on dev 39bef1108 by the coordinator: same)\n(drafting agent, PR tip 3269081cf, 2026-11-24)\n\nMEASURED\nFixture only. Not counted on any corpus tree (sbt/main and cats-core were measured for other fixes; operator defs there were not counted).\n\nNOT CHECKED\n- Scala: symbolic names in objects, traits and extension methods; backquoted names.\n- Ruby: `module Foo :: Bar`; whether any corpus Ruby file writes `::` with spaces.\n\nFixing either changes names and the stable ids that hash them, and adds symbols (Scala): needs a scheme bump (owner-ruled).\n\nFound 2026-11-23/24 while building PR #2354 (stable-id v19). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/STATUS.md lines 150-151 (locals agent's final message; locals/RESULTS.md defers its residuals to that message)"  # 74ba
    fields: {}  # 74ba
